Hi everyone, don't forget we have our African Drumming Workshop in Woodford this Saturday 11.00 - 12.30pm All ages, drums provided, everyone welcome and the person who wears the silliest socks WINS a prize!! Now that is going to be hilarious! Get creative people! Yay! Bookings must be made by Wednesday evening by phoning 0434585992 or emailing info@rhythmculture.com.au
